on the set of facts presented

00:01:18.734 --> 00:01:19.829
in the passage.

00:01:19.829 --> 00:01:22.029
You will read the passage
and then decide whether

00:01:22.029 --> 00:01:25.574
each conclusion is true, false,
or if there is insufficient

00:01:25.574 --> 00:01:27.030
information to decide.

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:29.052
This section contains 18 questions

00:01:29.052 --> 00:01:31.059
and you will have 30
minutes to complete it.

00:01:31.059 --> 00:01:34.030
